  Result: The bug in AnthropicChatFormatter that caused multiple tool_results to be split into separate user messages has been fixed by modifying the condition to flush content blocks only if no previous tool_result was handled. I ran the relevant DeepSeek formatter test that verifies multiple tool_results in a single assistant message, and it passed successfully with no errors. The issue is resolved.
